---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Navbar from '../../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';

const updated = "May 2025";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — The Clam AI"
  description="Terms and conditions for using The Clam AI platform."
>
  <Navbar />

  <main style="max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:140px 24px 80px;">

    <h1 style="font-size:36px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#ededed;margin:0 0 8px;">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p style="font-size:13px;color:#555;margin:0 0 48px;">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:32px;">

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;color:#ededed;margin:0 0 10px;">1. Acceptance</h2>
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:#888;line-height:1.75;margin:0;">
          By subscribing to or using The Clam AI ("Service"), you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the Service.
          These Terms constitute a binding contract between you ("Client") and The Clam AI.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;color:#ededed;margin:0 0 10px;">2. The Service</h2>
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:#888;line-height:1.75;margin:0;">
          The Clam AI provides a managed AI assistant that processes WhatsApp messages on behalf of hospitality businesses.
          The Service includes configuration, hosting, and ongoing model maintenance. We reserve the right to modify
          features with 14 days' notice.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;color:#ededed;margin:0 0 10px;">3. Subscriptions & billing</h2>
        <ul style="font-size:14px;color:#888;line-height:1.75;margin:0;padding-left:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;">
          <li>Plans are billed monthly in advance.</li>
          <li>No long-term contract is required — you may cancel at any time before the next billing cycle.</li>
          <li>There are no setup fees.</li>
          <li>Price changes will be communicated 30 days in advance.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;color:#ededed;margin:0 0 10px;">4. Refund policy</h2>
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:#888;line-height:1.75;margin:0;">
          We offer a full refund if you cancel within 7 days of your first charge and the AI assistant has not yet gone live.
          Once the Service is live, charges are non-refundable for the current billing period, but you will not be charged again
          after cancellation.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;color:#ededed;margin:0 0 10px;">5. Client responsibilities</h2>
        <ul style="font-size:14px;color:#888;line-height:1.75;margin:0;padding-left:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;">
          <li>You must provide accurate business information during onboarding.</li>
          <li>You are responsible for maintaining your WhatsApp Business account in good standing with Meta's policies.</li>
          <li>You must not use the Service for unlawful, deceptive, or abusive communications.</li>
          <li>You are responsible for informing your guests that automated AI may respond on your behalf.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;color:#ededed;margin:0 0 10px;">6. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:#888;line-height:1.75;margin:0;">
          The Clam AI shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from use of the Service.
          Our total liability in any 12-month period shall not exceed the fees paid by you during that period.
          The AI may occasionally produce inaccurate responses — you are responsible for reviewing critical operational decisions.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;color:#ededed;margin:0 0 10px;">7. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:#888;line-height:1.75;margin:0;">
          The Clam AI retains all rights to the platform software, AI models, and infrastructure.
          You retain ownership of your business data and guest conversation content.
          Upon termination, your data will be exported to you within 48 hours.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;color:#ededed;margin:0 0 10px;">8. Termination</h2>
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:#888;line-height:1.75;margin:0;">
          Either party may terminate at any time. We may suspend the Service immediately if you violate these Terms.
          On termination, access is revoked at end of the billing period and data is purged after the retention period defined in the Privacy Policy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;color:#ededed;margin:0 0 10px;">9. Governing law</h2>
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:#888;line-height:1.75;margin:0;">
          These Terms are governed by applicable law. Disputes shall be resolved by binding arbitration or in the courts of
          competent jurisdiction. If any provision is held invalid, the remainder of the Terms continues in effect.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;color:#ededed;margin:0 0 10px;">10. Contact</h2>
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:#888;line-height:1.75;margin:0;">
          Questions about these Terms? Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@theclamai.com" style="color:#D4AF37;">hello@theclamai.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>

  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
